# Regenerate with: npm run screenshots
Output "/tmp/hsdm-vhs-discard.gif"

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1180
Set Height 360
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "clear && HSDM_DEMO_DIR=/tmp/hsdm-demo ./scripts/demo.sh 2>/dev/null" Enter
Sleep 6s
Show
Sleep 3s
Screenshot assets/screenshot-portals.png
